Vendored MIT-licensed files from mimalloc
=========================================

The files in this directory are copied, unmodified, from the mimalloc
repository (https://github.com/microsoft/mimalloc) at tag v3.5.3, revision
d4881d338125e1cb7c47ba4cfb398d6f7c0c8d45. They are the allocator's own
sources and headers for the Unix and macOS builds; the Windows, WASI and
Emscripten layers, the override headers, the tests, the documentation and
the build files are left out.

