The package in the directory above compiles them through one wrapper file
(../qjs_mimalloc.c), because cgo builds only the C files of the package
directory itself. The engine allocates every JavaScript heap block with
mimalloc's own functions (mi_malloc and the rest); mimalloc does not replace
the C library's malloc.
